# TerraPulse 3D works 100% out-of-the-box with ZERO API keys required
# (USGS Earthquake GeoJSON, Open-Meteo Weather/Marine/AirQuality, Sensor.Community).
#
# Recommended for South Korea official real-time air quality (640+ stations):
# Register free at https://www.data.go.kr -> "한국환경공단_에어코리아_대기오염정보"
# (Optionally also apply for "한국환경공단_에어코리아_측정소정보" for exact per-station GPS)
# Accepts EITHER Encoding or Decoding service key automatically!
# DATA_GO_KR_API_KEY=

# Optional: PurpleAir Read API key to merge North America / global PurpleAir sensors
# PURPLEAIR_API_KEY=

# Optional: OpenWeather API key for extra weather overlays
# OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=
